    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.poster.avif?t=1754869813\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.webm?t=1754869813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.mp4?t=1754869813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover Super Rising Ball, is a and challenging  casual game! Rotate platforms with precision to make the ball rise to its next target and reach the top in this fun challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and fun gameplay:</strong> Rotate platforms with precision to help the ball rise and reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique customization:</strong> Unlock up to <strong>30 adorable skins</strong> for your ball and personalize your gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible album:</strong> Complete a unique album with more than <strong>70 collectibles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for everyone:</strong> Easy-to-learn controls, but with challenges to test your skills and reflexes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fun-filled experience in <strong>Super Rising Ball</strong>. Take your ball to the top!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.poster.avif?t=1754869813\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.webm?t=1754869813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397070/extras/59a61034a30e18217cade18ac15b6510.mp4?t=1754869813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover Super Rising Ball, is a and challenging  casual game! Rotate platforms with precision to make the ball rise to its next target and reach the top in this fun challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and fun gameplay:</strong> Rotate platforms with precision to help the ball rise and reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique customization:</strong> Unlock up to <strong>30 adorable skins</strong> for your ball and personalize your gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible album:</strong> Complete a unique album with more than <strong>70 collectibles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for everyone:</strong> Easy-to-learn controls, but with challenges to test your skills and reflexes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fun-filled experience in <strong>Super Rising Ball</strong>. Take your ball to the top!</p>",
